  uniform_prefix  [§10.2]
  predicted in advance: B5 WINS. Every request shares the same prefix, so every replica caches it after warmup and prefix awareness degenerates to 'pick any replica'. This is the naive mental model of prefix caching and the case where the clever router is worth nothing.

